{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo Version of Infploria you can already mine most Ores and have a small experience of the Full Version. Infploria is a procedurally generated Game that is about mining to the Core of the Earth, in order to mine coresium, the most valuable and rarest Ore of them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Following Features are already present in this Demo Version:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Mining Coal, Gold, Iron, Diamond and even Coresium, the Ore at the Core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Using TNT to quickly gather Stone and Ore Resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Using Flashlights to brighten up the Cave's surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Swap your Tools to break Crates, Barrels, Mine, or fight Critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666240/extras/Infploria_Mining.gif?t=1746781399\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666240?t=1746781399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666240?t=1746781399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666240/b4e1ebed0495ac00d0be16ccba1f9c405b387669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746781399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666240/b4e1ebed0495ac00d0be16ccba1f9c405b387669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746781399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo Version of Infploria you can already mine most Ores and have a small experience of the Full Version. Infploria is a procedurally generated Game that is about mining to the Core of the Earth, in order to mine core